cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: Building2Building
abstract: >-
  A large-scale reinforcement learning benchmark for HVAC control,
  exposing 6,000 parametrically generated EnergyPlus building models as
  Gymnasium environments across 6 building types, 16 ASHRAE climate
  zones, and 3 HVAC system types.
